WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.420
- Let's get to our first guest though.

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:04.590
He is very funny, very
talented. I love him so much.

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:06.390
I do think he stole a guitar off the wall

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:07.960
the last time he was at our show.

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:09.123
So he's a kleptomaniac. It's fine.

00:00:09.123 --> 00:00:12.010
His new podcast is called Black Box.

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:13.890
You can listen on Apple, Spotify,

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:15.550
and wherever you get your podcasts.

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:17.253
Give it up for Joel McHale!

00:00:18.398 --> 00:00:19.315
Oh my gosh!

00:00:20.238 --> 00:00:21.071
- Hello!

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:23.102
Come on, guys.

00:00:23.102 --> 00:00:23.980
- [Kelly] Oh, they are adorable!

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:24.853
- [Joel] Yeah.

00:00:24.853 --> 00:00:26.520
- [Kelly] Oh my God!

00:00:30.093 --> 00:00:31.179
- Oh, come on, come on.

00:00:31.179 --> 00:00:34.144
There we go, you're okay. You're okay.

00:00:34.144 --> 00:00:36.310
- [Kelly] He's like,
the stairs are freaky...

00:00:36.310 --> 00:00:37.143
There you go!

00:00:37.143 --> 00:00:37.976
- [Joel] There we go.

00:00:37.976 --> 00:00:38.809
Come on.

00:00:38.809 --> 00:00:40.320
Come on, guys, let's go!

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:42.143
- Oh my gosh, you brought pigs!

00:00:42.143 --> 00:00:43.810
- These are for you!

00:00:47.048 --> 00:00:48.381
- Come on over!

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:51.821
Oh, can I feed? I want... Can I feed?

00:00:51.821 --> 00:00:53.070
- Yeah, you want to feed 'em?

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:53.903
- Yes!

00:00:53.903 --> 00:00:55.080
- I hope this works.

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:56.510
- Okay. Okay.

00:00:56.510 --> 00:00:58.500
- Their names of Spiderman and MJ.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.730
- Oh my God. I love it.

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:00.750
Do you want some?

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:03.423
- And I just named them ten seconds ago.

00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:05.353
There you go.

00:01:05.353 --> 00:01:06.186
You just stay there.
- You want it?

00:01:06.186 --> 00:01:07.019
- There we are.

00:01:08.470 --> 00:01:10.290
- It's everywhere, but it's okay.

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:11.810
Do I know how to do this?

00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:12.702
- [Joel] You're doing great.

00:01:12.702 --> 00:01:15.720
You clearly have done this with babies,

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:17.620
where you dangle the bottle over them.

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:18.750
- [Kelly] I'm trying.

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:20.180
- [Joel] It makes them want it.

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:21.690
- [Kelly] I'm trying so hard.

00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:22.523
- Do it!

00:01:22.523 --> 00:01:23.630
I'm failing, you try.

00:01:23.630 --> 00:01:25.028
- [Joel] Well, it's matcha,
so I don't know if...

00:01:25.028 --> 00:01:26.260
- Oh!

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:27.590
- There you go, bud.

00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:28.423
Yeah.

00:01:28.423 --> 00:01:29.830
Where are you going?

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:30.663
- [Kelly] Where are you going?

00:01:30.663 --> 00:01:31.740
(Kelly chuckles)

00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:33.760
- Kelly, my goal is
for you to never ask me

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:34.703
a single question...

00:01:34.703 --> 00:01:35.536
- (Kelly laughs)

00:01:35.536 --> 00:01:38.530
- That you'll just be completely
distracted the entire time.

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:40.520
- I never knew I wanted a little pig.

00:01:40.520 --> 00:01:41.700
- [Joel] Well, the good news is,

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:44.460
in about two years, there'll
be 600 pounds a piece.

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:45.420
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh!

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:48.310
- So that's a fun, fun
animal to have in your home.

00:01:48.310 --> 00:01:50.270
- I've actually had pigs before in Texas.

00:01:50.270 --> 00:01:51.103
- Really?

00:01:51.103 --> 00:01:53.420
- Yeah, but they were
like on our rescue farm,

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:55.810
so they were a pet, but we rescued them.

00:01:55.810 --> 00:01:57.790
I didn't have them from like a piglet.

00:01:57.790 --> 00:01:58.623
- You didn't raise them.

00:01:58.623 --> 00:01:59.456
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:59.456 --> 00:02:00.747
I couldn't think of the word. Thank you.

00:02:00.747 --> 00:02:01.580
(Kelly laughs)
- [Joel] No, no, it's...

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:02.413
- Raise them!

00:02:02.413 --> 00:02:05.330
- See, I do raise pigs for a living.

00:02:05.330 --> 00:02:06.163
- [Kelly] You do?

00:02:06.163 --> 00:02:06.996
- Yeah

00:02:06.996 --> 00:02:08.351
- [Kelly] You do so much, Joel.

